sistant/hive-mind.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","homepage":"","size":496236,"stargazers_count":89,"watchers_count":89,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":17,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":273,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":17,"open_issues":273,"watchers":89,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":false}},"body":"## Problem\n\n`/agent https://github.com/konard/test-hello-world-019fb330-00e1-73b9-955e-f357a1600d5b/issues/1 --model formal-ai` (2026-10-13, Hive Mind 2.35.8, agent 0.26.13), session `435374e0-3e09-4e3d-9b8e-05f63a29093d`, execution `05c82f00-9417-4ebb-8c8c-97f2b893dd00`, log (private gist): https://gist.github.com/konard/a26a79ab44357a50859a51ff7f762af6\n\n- Formal AI's first tool call was `read` on `…/e.g` (link-assistant/formal-ai#1189) → `File not found`, an ordinary tool result.\n- `@link-assistant/agent` emits a top-level `{\"type\":\"error\"}` for every failed tool call (link-assistant/agent#332).\n- Hive Mind's streaming detection (`src/agent.lib.mjs` ~827, issue #1201) and `resolveStreamingErrorRecovery` (`src/agent-command.lib.mjs` ~107-120) treat it as fatal: \"Agent exited 0 after an error event; the error event in its output still fails the run\".\n- Reported: `❌ AGENT execution failed with Agent reported error: Error: File not found: /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1791929210941/e.g` — the reason shown is a tool error, not why the session really failed (Formal AI stopped and asked \"Reply `Report issue`\", link-assistant/formal-ai#1205).\n\nAny recoverable tool error fails an `/agent` run, with every model.\n\n## Expected\n\n- An error event whose payload is a tool part (`part.type === \"tool\"`, or the `recoverable`/`tool_error` marker that link-assistant/agent#332 adds) is not fatal; only session-level errors are.\n- Success/failure of an agent run follows the session result (exit code, final message, progress made), and the failure reason names the last fatal event.\n- Test with a recorded stream: a failed `read` followed by a successful turn is a success.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3213/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3214","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3214/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3214/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3214/events","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3214","id":5842385349,"node_id":"I_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABXDu5xQ","number":3214,"title":"In-place resume from a committed dind container: nested dockerd refuses to start ('delete /var/run/docker.pid: process with PID 25 is still running')","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use