istant/hive-mind/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/deployments","created_at":"2025-07-28T19:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:22:27Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-14T18:03:39Z","git_url":"git://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:link-assistant/hive-mind.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","homepage":"","size":496236,"stargazers_count":89,"watchers_count":89,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":17,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":273,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":17,"open_issues":273,"watchers":89,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":false}},"body":"## Summary\n\nMerging #3225 closed **11 formal-ai issues that nothing had fixed**: link-assistant/formal-ai#1207, link-assistant/formal-ai#1189, link-assistant/formal-ai#1201, link-assistant/formal-ai#1203, link-assistant/formal-ai#1204, link-assistant/formal-ai#1205, link-assistant/formal-ai#1206, link-assistant/formal-ai#1208, link-assistant/formal-ai#1209, link-assistant/formal-ai#1210 and link-assistant/formal-ai#1211, all at 2026-10-14T17:11:41–48Z. formal-ai `main` has no commit after v0.353.2 (`8d2430d5c`, 2026-10-13), and #3225's own description lists \"formal-ai#1189, #1205–#1207, #1209 and #1211\" as the Formal AI issues that **remain open upstream**. They were reopened by hand on 2026-10-15. (link-assistant/formal-ai#1153 was delivered, because the slim image is published and Hive Mind prefers it, so it stays closed.)\n\nThis is the bug class of #3174, in its cross-repository form. It is worse there, because the other repository's maintainers see their issues closed by a merge in a repository they do not watch.\n\n## How it happened\n\n- #3215 (the source issue of #3225) had link-assistant/formal-ai#1207 as a native sub-issue, and #1207 has 11 sub-issues in formal-ai.\n- [`fetchRequiredIssueScope`](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/blob/d0084ee/src/issue-link-verification.lib.mjs#L35-L55) walks the whole sub-issue tree, **including nodes in other repositories** (`normalizeSubIssueEntry` keeps their owner/repo), and marks every node as required.\n- [`repairRequiredIssueLinks`](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/blob/d0084ee/src/pr-issue-link-repair.lib.mjs#L18-L44) appended `Fixes link-assistant/formal-ai#N` for each of them ([L32](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/blob/d0084ee/src/pr-issue-link-repair.lib.mjs#L32)). That is lines 97–119 of #3225's description, after the agent's own `Fixes` line, which named only hive-mind issues.\n- GitHub closes issues in other repositories of the same owner on merge. So the merge closed all 11.\n\n## Fix\n\n1. **Never require or add a closing reference for an issue in another repository.** A pull request can only fix code in its own repository. Walk sub-issues in other repositories for context, but never add them to the required scope.\n2. Respect a description that says an issue stays open, as #3174 asks. A `Fixes` line the repair added must be removed again when the description lists that issue as remaining open.\n3. Before any merge (auto or by command), compare `closingIssuesReferences` with what the PR implements. Refuse to merge, with a comment naming them, when it would close an issue in another repository.\n\n## Done when\n\n- A unit test reproduces this tree (#3215 → formal-ai#1207 → 11 formal-ai sub-issues): `repairRequiredIssueLinks` adds no `Fixes owner/other-repo#N` line, and the merge guard refuses a PR whose `closingIssuesReferences` contain another repository's issue.\n- Cross-repository sub-issues can be attached to umbrellas again without risk. Until then, umbrellas here link other repositories' issues only in their text.\n\nParent: #3174.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3276/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3276/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}]]{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2406","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2406/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2406/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2406/events","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2406","id":5674958255,"node_id":"I_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABUkD9rw","number":2406,"title":"Require complete issue delivery before automated merges: prompts, Codex goals and requirements evidence","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-02T08:35:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T08:35:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3282","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Split from #2335, as [requested on PR #2336](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/2336#issuecomment-5948156787): PR #2336 keeps only the links between issues and pull requests; the prompt and goal changes move here.\n\n## Background\n\n[Agent PR #326](https://github.com/link-assistant/agent/pull/326) was merged automatically after CI passed, although its own description said [Agent issue #322](https://github.com/link-assistant/agent/issues/322) was not finished. PR #2336 fixes the link half of that incident (negated and foreign references are no longer treated as links, every required issue is linked and repaired, and the merge is blocked while a required issue link is missing or unconfirmed). A correctly linked PR can still be incomplete, which is what this issue covers.\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **Prompts:** every tool (Claude, Codex, Agent, OpenCode, Gemini, Qwen) gets the same complete-delivery goal in its system, initial and continuation prompts, including the short Claude resume prompt: every requirement of every required issue must be done in the one pull request, or left explicitly unfinished.\n2. **Native goals:** where a tool supports a persistent goal, use it. For Codex, keep `features.goals=true` in both the direct and the agent-commander invocation, independently of `--auxiliary-model-calls-disabled` (the incident log shows `features.goals=false`).\n3. **Completion evidence:** a requirements report in the PR description, tied to the current head commit and to the issue/comment/review sources, listing every explicit acceptance criterion with status and evidence.\n4. **Merge guard:** automated merges of issue-scoped PRs require a current, complete report; reads fail closed, and the merge is pinned with `--match-head-commit`.\n5. **Automatic completion retries:** when the report is missing, stale or has unfinished items, continue working in the same PR with bounded retries, without needing optional restart flags.\n6. **Docs and tests:** an operating guide in all four languages, and tests with the same 100% coverage of the new modules.\n\nThe full implementation already exists as the state of PR #2336 before the split and will be opened as a pull request stacked on #2336.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2406/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}[[]]{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2303","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2303/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2303/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2303/events","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2303","id":5599653970,"node_id":"I_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABTcPwUg","number":2303,"title":"`✅ Work session finished successfully` yet actually it got memory killed","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9018391179,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAACGYm6iw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-27T04:17:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T04:17:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":{"id":29937030,"node_id":"IT_kwDODp_H0c4ByM2G","name":"Bug","description":"An unexpected problem or behavior","color":"red","created_at":"2025-11-21T09:35:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T09:35:16Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lin