eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","description":"The AI that controls AIs to do the automation of automation.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/deployments","created_at":"2025-07-28T19:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:22:27Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-14T18:03:39Z","git_url":"git://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:link-assistant/hive-mind.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","homepage":"","size":496236,"stargazers_count":89,"watchers_count":89,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":17,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":273,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":17,"open_issues":273,"watchers":89,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":false}},"body":"> **Status 2026-10-15: reopened. The Hive Mind side is merged, but the \"Done when\" is not met.**\n> - #3225 merged 2026-10-14 and was released as **2.35.10**, with agent pinned to 0.26.15 (link-assistant/agent#332 was fixed in agent 0.26.14). It closed #3206–#3214, #2630 and #3248.\n> - The production host still runs 2.35.8 (agent 0.26.14); the deploy is pending.\n> - #3225 itself says \"No live end-to-end run\". That run is #3277.\n> - Its known limitations are now #3278 (the remaining sync calls and lint gaps) and #3279 (Formal AI parity for `/claude` and `/codex`).\n> - The merge also **closed 11 formal-ai issues that nothing had fixed**, through the link repair's cross-repository sub-issue walk (#3276, the #3174 class). They were reopened. Their umbrella link-assistant/formal-ai#1207 was moved under link-assistant/formal-ai#1162 and is now referenced here only in text, so the next merge cannot close it again.\n> - The leftover `recovery/issue-*` branches (12, listed in #3225) are still on the remote. Deleting them needs a maintainer's OK.\n\n## Goal\n\nFormal AI is supported at every level like the OpenAI and Anthropic models: `/claude`, `/codex` and `/agent` with `--model formal-ai` each produce the simplest Hello World pull request, meeting all the requirements (new commit, green CI, ready for review), without blocking the bot or anyone else's task, and with an honest Telegram/PR report when they fail.\n\n## Runs on 2026-10-13 (Hive Mind 2.35.8, start-command 0.37.1, agent 0.26.13, Formal AI 0.352.1 from `konard/hive-mind-dind:2.35.8`)\n\nOptions locked for all: `--attach-logs --verbose --no-tool-check --disable-report-issue --isolation docker`.\n\n| Command | Session / execution | Telegram said | Reality | Log (private gist, sanitized) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `/codex …019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/issues/1` (Rust) | `67c6a8b5-28ce-48f7-ba89-8e33278f2749` / `4d45ad2c-90e8-45b7-92eb-1c63aa270972` | ✅ after 11 s, then \"⏳ Executing…\" forever | bot frozen 10 min by the image pull; 73 identical tool calls; restart iteration hit ChatGPT; exit 1, never reported | https://gist.github.com/konard/b5819c8d2e68268c18f34ba97f0b7601 |\n| `/agent …019fb330-00e1-73b9-955e-f357a1600d5b/issues/1` (Scala) | `435374e0-3e09-4e3d-9b8e-05f63a29093d` / `05c82f00-9417-4ebb-8c8c-97f2b893dd00` | ❌ exit 1 | a recoverable tool error was treated as fatal; Formal AI stopped and asked \"Reply `Report issue`\" | https://gist.github.com/konard/a26a79ab44357a50859a51ff7f762af6 |\n| `/claude …019fb330-fa49-7c9d-a664-b7ea33bb698a/issues/1` (Kotlin) | `e5faacab-558b-4c7d-b50c-73c4dfd61851` / `ee51df2f-6515-4273-bb9d-1785f662fbe4` | ✅ 4m 19s, PR marked ready | 2 turns, no commit by this session (false success) | https://gist.github.com/konard/150f5af4368249c49b6d20dad9f69fcf |\n\nAlso on that host the same evening: `/claude https://github.com/Godmy/stylist-svelte/issues/5`, execution `1a664acf-1a63-4973-a4a7-32fc9088c98e`: cgroup OOM, then the in-place resume exited 127 on `/claude` (#2630) and its nested dockerd did not start (#3214). Log: https://gist.github.com/konard/e4da8ea546db12107d0d4add1be34dd1\n\n## Sub-issues\n\nHive Mind:\n- #3206 bot freezes for all chats while a command prepares its task (polling stall), plus the sync-I/O audit and lint rules\n- #3207 sidecar image: remote pull before the local image, timeout reported as `unknown`, cancelled pull leaks ~17.7 GB for 6 h\n- #3208 updater/unload/fail-closed: the next Formal AI task must re-pull 7 GB of an update nobody used, or fail closed with nothing migrated\n- #3209 false \"✅ finished\" before the container existed, and the real failure never reported\n- #3210 sidecar lease kept 1 h after the task container exited\n- #3211 no-progress sessions reported as success (claude 2 turns → ready + 🎉; codex 73× loop → ✅)\n- #3212 codex auto-restart loses the Formal AI provider → ChatGPT 400 → reported as \"Authentication error\"\n- #3213 `/agent` fails on any recoverable tool error\n- #3214 stale `/var/run/docker.pid` breaks dind on in-place resume\n- #2630 kill/OOM recovery runs the Telegram alias `/claude` as a program (exit 127), still on 2.35.8 / start-command 0.37.1\n- #3248 CI: the `Formal AI Draft` workflow (`issues: opened`) failed on 53 of the last 60 issues. The root cause is the `e.g` read error chain (link-assistant/formal-ai#1189 → agent#332 → #3213), then `planned_not_executed`. The issue also covers a false \"log not attached\" comment, Formal AI cache pushed as recovery branches, no retry on the image pull, and checks not visible on the draft PR\n\nOpen follow-ups (2026-10-15):\n- #3277 live verification after deploying 2.35.10 (this issue's Done when)\n- #3278 finish #3206: 123 baselined sync calls, `require-exec-timeout` blind to `$` calls\n- #3279 Formal AI parity: attribution only with `--tool agent`, cost overrides per tool\n- #3276 (under #3174) link repair closed 11 unfixed formal-ai issues through cross-repository sub-issues\n\nDependencies:\n- link-assistant/agent#332 failed tool calls emitted as fatal top-level `error` events (fixed in agent 0.26.14)\n- link-assistant/formal-ai#1207 (text link only, see status; reopened, under link-assistant/formal-ai#1162) Formal AI side of these runs (link-assistant/formal-ai#1154, link-assistant/formal-ai#1156, link-assistant/formal-ai#1189, link-assistant/formal-ai#1205, link-assistant/formal-ai#1206) and the half-published 0.353.x release (link-assistant/formal-ai#1203, link-assistant/formal-ai#1204, link-assistant/formal-ai#1201, link-assistant/formal-ai#1153); from CI: link-assistant/formal-ai#1208 derivation records written into the user's repo, link-assistant/formal-ai#1209 `planned_not_executed` regression, link-assistant/formal-ai#1211 garbage files written and claimed as verified, and link-assistant/formal-ai#1210 the same per-issue Hive Mind draft for formal-ai's own issues\n\n## Formal AI version on the host\n\nGitHub Releases' latest is 0.352.1; 0.353.2 exists on crates.io and ghcr (`latest`) without a GitHub Release (link-assistant/formal-ai#1203). The tasks ran **0.352.1** (from the Hive Mind image). The updater pulled and accepted **0.353.2** at 23:22 UTC, no task used it, and the 5 h unload removed it at 04:10 UTC (#3208).\n\n## Done when\n\nOn a host with no Formal AI image cached, `/claude`, `/codex` and `/agent` with `--model formal-ai` on fresh Hello World test repositories (a different language each) each end with a pull request containing a new commit, green CI and a correct program, and other users' commands are answered within seconds throughout. Any failure is reported in Telegram and on the PR with its real cause. In CI, every new issue in hive-mind and formal-ai gets a Formal AI draft through Hive Mind, and its result links the complete session log (#3248, link-assistant/formal-ai#1210).\n\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3215/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3174","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","labels_url":"https://api.gith