lse},"html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","description":"The AI that controls AIs to do the automation of automation.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/deployments","created_at":"2025-07-28T19:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:22:27Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-14T18:03:39Z","git_url":"git://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:link-assistant/hive-mind.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","homepage":"","size":496236,"stargazers_count":89,"watchers_count":89,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":17,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":273,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":17,"open_issues":273,"watchers":89,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":false}},"body":"## Problem\n\nOn 2026-10-13 (Hive Mind 2.35.8, host with Docker 29.6.1 / containerd image store), the first `--model formal-ai` task on the host (`/codex …`, session `67c6a8b5-28ce-48f7-ba89-8e33278f2749`, execution `4d45ad2c-90e8-45b7-92eb-1c63aa270972`) spent **10 minutes** pulling an image it did not need, and the cancelled pull leaked **~17.7 GB** of disk for 6 hours:\n\n1. `resolveFormalAiSidecarImageCandidates` (`src/formal-ai-image.lib.mjs:205`) tries `ghcr.io/link-assistant/formal-ai:0.352.1` (6.20 GB compressed, 24.3 GB on disk) **before** the local `konard/hive-mind-dind:2.35.8`, which already bakes the same Formal AI 0.352.1 and was on the host.\n2. `docker pull` ran 21:52:05 → 22:02:05 UTC and was killed by `DEFAULT_DOCKER_TIMEOUT_MS = 600_000` (`:65`). A killed `execFile` has empty stderr, so `classifyDockerRegistryError` returned `kind: 'unknown'`, \"the pull failed\" — the log does not say it timed out.\n3. Then the local image was used, and the sidecar was healthy in seconds:\n   `[VERBOSE] formal-ai-image: using 'konard/hive-mind-dind:2.35.8' (hive-mind-image) already present locally`.\n4. The cancelled pull left 49 Formal-AI-only content blobs (6.20 GB) and 30 unpacked snapshots referenced by no image or container (11.90 GiB), held by containerd lease `670759184-l9sp` with `containerd.io/gc.expire` 6 h after the pull (dockerd: `Cancel with lease, leased resources will remain until expiration`, `failed to cleanup extract-… NotFound`). On this host that was 63 GB used instead of ~45 GB until the lease expired.\n5. All of it ran inside the Telegram update handler, freezing the bot (separate sub-issue).\n\n## Expected\n\n- **Prefer what is already on the host**: if a local image provides the required Formal AI version (the Hive Mind image bakes it; its version is known), use it first; pull only when no local image qualifies.\n- **Pull the slim image** (`ghcr.io/link-assistant/formal-ai:<v>-slim`, 0.33 GB compressed for 0.353.2) for the sidecar, which only runs `formal-ai serve` (link-assistant/formal-ai#1153).\n- Pull in the background with progress, never on the request path; a timeout is reported as `kind: 'timeout'` (\"did not finish in 10 min\"), with the bytes done.\n- After a cancelled/timed-out pull, release what it left: `docker image prune` does not reach lease-held content, so either avoid the cancel (let the background pull finish) or report the leaked size and the lease expiry in the log, and let the disk-cleanup path account for it.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3207/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3208","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3208/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3208/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3208/events","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3208","id":5842384033,"node_id":"I_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABXDu0oQ","number":3208,"title":"Formal AI updater accepts an image no task used, unload deletes it 5 h later, and the next task must re-pull 7 GB or fail closed although no memory was migrated","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-14T05:17:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:11:35Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T17:11:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3215","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"repository":{"id":1027945641,"node_id":"R_kgDOPUU0qQ","name":"hive-mind","full_name":"link-assistant/hive-mind","private":false,"owner":{"login":"link-assistant","id":245352401,"node_id":"O_kgDODp_H0Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245352401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-assistant/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","description":"The AI that controls AIs to do the automation of automation.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/deployments","created_at":"2025-07-28T19:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:22:27Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-14T18:03:39Z","git_url":"git://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:link-assistant/hive-mind.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","homepage":"","size":496236,"stargazers_count":89,"watchers_count":89,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":17,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":273,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":17,"open_issues":273,"watchers":89,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":false}},"body":"## Problem\n\nThe Formal AI updater, the 5-hour unload and the fail-closed rule combine so that the *next* Formal AI task on a host depends on re-downloading a 7 GB image within 10 minutes, for an update that was never used:\n\nState on the host now (`~/.hive-mind/state/formal-ai-sidecar.json`, read 2026-10-14 05:20 UTC):\n\n```json\n\"lastUpdate\": { \"image\": \"ghcr.io/link-assistant/formal-ai:latest\", \"digest\": \"sha256:01da160c…\", \"version\": \"0.353.2\",\n                \"migrationId\": null, \"memorySchemaVersion\": null, \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-13T23:22:54.764Z\" },\n\"serving\":    { \"image\": \"konard/hive-mind-dind:2.35.8\", \"version\": \"0.352.1\", \"memorySchemaVersion\": null, \"observedAt\": \"2026-10-13T22:10:58.172Z\" },\n\"lastUsedAt\": \"2026-10-13T23:09:05.730Z\",\n\"lastUnload\": { \"at\": \"2026-10-14T04:10:20.038Z\", \"images\": [\"sha256:01da160c…\"], \"bytesFreed\": 28970000000 }\n```\n\nTimeline (UTC): tasks ran Formal AI **0.352.1** (from the Hive Mind image) at 22:02–22:18 → the updater pulled and **accepted** `formal-ai:latest` = **0.353.2** at 23:22 (the 0.353.x tags have no GitHub Release yet: link-assistant/formal-ai#1203) → no task used it → the unload removed it at 04:10 (\"Formal AI unloaded (unused for 5h1s): removed 1 image… freeing 28.97GB\").\n\nConsequences:\n\n1. `resolveAcceptedFormalAiImageCandidates` (`src/formal-ai-image.lib.mjs:170`) now returns only the accepted 0.353.2 candidates (not local, so it pulls the repo digest / `:0.353.2` / `:latest`, 7.12 GB compressed) under the same 600 s timeout. If that pull fails, the task fails closed: \"Hive Mind will not fall back to an older Formal AI release against memory an accepted update already migrated.\"\n2. But nothing was migrated: `migrationId: null`, `memorySchemaVersion: null`, and the sidecar health check logged `memory schema=unknown` for the image that actually served. The fail-closed rule (issue #2207) is applied without the condition it exists for.\n3. The updater pulls and accepts updates for a host where Formal AI is idle and about to be unloaded, then the unload deletes the update: 7 GB downloaded and 29 GB unpacked for nothing, every release.\n4. `formal-ai-unload: no Formal AI image on this host` is logged while `konard/hive-mind-dind:2.35.8` (which serves Formal AI) is present, and `bytesFreed` reports the uncompressed size, not the disk actually freed (shared layers).\n\n## Expected\n\n- Fail closed only when the accepted update really migrated memory (`migrationId`/`memorySchemaVersion` set). Otherwise fall back to the newest locally available image, with a visible warning.\n- The updater does not pull for an idle host (or pulls the slim image), and an update is \"accepted\" only once a task has run on it; or the unload keeps the accepted image's identity so the next task pulls in the background before the task needs it.\n- The sidecar health reports a real `memory.schema_version` (Formal AI side, if missing) so the state is not `unknown`.\n- The unload log and `bytesFreed` describe the real effect.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3208/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3209","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3209/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3209/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3209/events","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3209","id":5842384240,"node_id":"I_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABXDu1cA","number":3209,"title":"Docker session reported '✅ finished successfully' after 11 s before its container existed (exitCode null → 0); the real failure 26 min later was never reported (#2189 latch)","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url