ts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/deployments","created_at":"2025-07-28T19:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:22:27Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-14T18:03:39Z","git_url":"git://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:link-assistant/hive-mind.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","homepage":"","size":496236,"stargazers_count":89,"watchers_count":89,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":17,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":273,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":17,"open_issues":273,"watchers":89,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":false}},"body":"## Problem\n\nIn the `--auto-restart-until-mergeable` iteration of a `--model formal-ai` codex run, Codex was started **without the Formal AI provider** and called ChatGPT. Then the failure was reported with the wrong reason.\n\n`/codex https://github.com/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/issues/1 --model formal-ai` (2026-10-13, Hive Mind 2.35.8), execution `4d45ad2c-90e8-45b7-92eb-1c63aa270972`, log (private gist): https://gist.github.com/konard/b5819c8d2e68268c18f34ba97f0b7601\n\n| | First iteration | Restart iteration 1/5 (22:17 UTC) |\n|---|---|---|\n| `🧠 Formal AI: local wrapper / serving backend / protocol / config CODEX_HOME=…/formal-ai/codex-…` | present | **absent** |\n| `🧭 Formal AI pinned to verified Codex capability state: …/repositories/konard/test-hello-world-…` | present | **absent** |\n| Capability preflight on the repository-scoped `CODEX_HOME` | yes | yes (re-run, rewrites that home) |\n| Codex result | talked to Formal AI | `turn.failed` **400 \"The 'formal-ai' model is not supported when using Codex with a ChatGPT account.\"** |\n\nThe printed command is identical in both iterations (`export FORMAL_AI_API_KEY=[REDACTED]; export CODEX_HOME=/home/box/.codex/hive-mind/repositories/…; codex exec --model \"formal-ai\" …`), so the difference is the `config.toml` in that home: the restart's capability preflight wrote a fresh one, and the Formal AI provider block that `executeCodex` copies in (`src/codex.lib.mjs` ~661-680) was not copied again because `resolveFormalAiToolExecution` did not run/log in the restart path (`solve.keep-working.lib.mjs` → `solve.restart-shared.lib.mjs` → `executeCodex`). Exact cause still to be confirmed with verbose logging in that path.\n\nThen the outcome was misreported:\n\n- PR comment: \"🚨 Solution Draft Failed … Reason: **Authentication error**\".\n- `ℹ️ PR #2 stays a draft: Model metadata for \\`formal-ai\\` not found. Defaulting to fallback metadata…` — a non-fatal Codex warning shown as the failure cause.\n- The real cause (the provider was not Formal AI; ChatGPT rejected the model) appears nowhere in the summary.\n\n## Expected\n\n- Every iteration (first, auto-restart, auto-continue, resume) of a Formal AI run goes through the same Formal AI wiring and logs the `🧠 Formal AI:` lines; a test asserts that the restart's `CODEX_HOME/config.toml` names the Formal AI provider.\n- If the wiring cannot be applied, fail with \"Formal AI provider not configured\" before starting Codex. Never let a Formal AI run reach a vendor endpoint (#2146 fail-closed).\n- `turn.failed` 400 \"model is not supported\" is classified as a configuration error, not \"Authentication error\", and the \"Model metadata … not found\" warning is never reported as the failure reason.\n- Codex shows \"Model metadata for `formal-ai` not found\" on every turn: register model metadata for `formal-ai` in the generated config (context window etc.) so Codex has none of these fallbacks, as for OpenAI models.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3212/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3213","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3213/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3213/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3213/events","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3213","id":5842385131,"node_id":"I_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABXDu46w","number":3213,"title":"/agent run fails on any recoverable tool error: a failed read ('e.g', File not found) is treated as a fatal error event","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url"